    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_drugs_medicinal_botanicals): Named materia medica (castoreum, ginseng, cubebs, scammony, maidenhair, liquorice juice, quassia, cocculus indicus, serpentary, asafoetida, cantharides, hellebore, pipsissewa, ipecacuanha) left in the residual bin. Layer-1 observations: 5 rows, 1837–1842. Series: CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×5. Units: Lbs. (Pounds) ×4; Packages ×1. Top routes: Montreal and Quebec → Great Britain ×5."@en ;
